      "writtenOn": "2021-12-03T18:30:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agree that, this 2nd method can remove the config dependency.\nBut, if adding a dependency for extra flag , say - BATTERY_TYPE_COUNT, we will need the relevant changes under other board files, forcing it to return BATTERY_TYPE_COUNT.\nNow, with this Config(CONFIG_BATTERY_TYPE_NO_AUTO_DETECT)  option introduced , we are safe to check only the relevant index parameter info just for the boards where this config is enabled. In the preceding CL:3220899, based on board id, correct index is returned for either 3S or 2S.",
